1818 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Product and UX Designer with 5\053 years of experience delivering enterprise digital experiences for Fortune 500 clients across Healthcare\054 Utilities\054 and Food and Beverage\056 Expert in design systems\054 end\055to\055end product design\054 and client\055facing consulting\056 Background in journalism sharpens how I research\054 communicate\054 and tell stories through design\056\n\nCORE SKILLS\nUX \046 PRODUCT DESIGN\nProduct Design\240 \174\240 UX\057UI Design\240 \174\240 Interaction Design\240 \174\240 Wireframing\240 \174\240 Prototyping\240 \174\240 User Flows\240 \174\240 Journey Mapping\240 \174\240 Information Architecture\240 \174\240 Responsive Web\240 \174\240 Mobile\240 \174\240 Conversational UI\nDESIGN SYSTEMS \046 VISUAL\nDesign Systems\240 \174\240 Style Guides\240 \174\240 Component Libraries\240 \174\240 Scalable UI Architecture\240 \174\240 Visual Design\240 \174\240 Accessibility \050WCAG\051\240 \174\240 Brand Alignment\nRESEARCH \046 DELIVERY\nUser Research\240 \174\240 Usability Testing\240 \174\240 Workshop Facilitation\240 \174\240 Stakeholder Management\240 \174\240 Agile\240 \174\240 Design QA\240 \174\240 Cross\055Functional Collaboration\240 \174\240 Enterprise UX\240 \174\240 Storytelling\nTOOLS \046 TECHNOLOGIES\nFigma \050Expert\051\240 \174\240 AI\055Enabled Tools \050Claude\054 Figma Make\051\240 \174\240 Miro\240 \174\240 Jira\240 \174\240 Azure DevOps\240 \174\240 Notion\240 \174\240 ProPresenter\n\nPROFESSIONAL EXPERIENCE\nProduct Designer \050Consultant\051 \240 Accenture\054 Chicago\054 IL\nAug 2021 \055 Jan 2026\nPartnered with 10\053 Fortune 500 clients across Healthcare\054 Utilities\054 and Food and Beverage to design intuitive\054 visually compelling digital experiences connecting user needs\054 brand expression\054 and business goals across responsive web and mobile platforms\056\nLed end\055to\055end product design across the full process\072 discovery\054 user research\054 journey mapping\054 wireframing\054 prototyping\054 high\055fidelity design\054 and delivery\054 collaborating with cross\055functional teams of product managers\054 engineers\054 and client stakeholders\056\nAuthored and evolved 5\053 enterprise design systems and component libraries from scratch and from existing brand guidelines\054 driving consistency\054 scalability\054 and usability across products and teams\056\nDesigned 600\053 scalable Figma components and produced 50\053 interactive prototypes for stakeholder workshops\054 usability testing sessions\054 and client presentations\054 accelerating feedback cycles and design decision\055making\056\nApplied user\055centered design methods and usability testing insights to simplify complex multi\055system workflows\054 including a unified digital platform combining three legacy utility companies into one seamless customer experience\056\nDesigned conversational UI flows and dialogue architecture for Chase Bank\047s Business banking chatbot\054 mapping user intent\054 edge cases\054 error states\054 and recovery paths across voice and text interaction channels\056\nRan design QA during development phases\054 ensuring developers had clear documentation and design intent needed to implement experiences accurately and on spec\056\nIntegrated AI\055enabled tools throughout the design process from research and ideation to prototyping and delivery\054 accelerating iteration and improving decision\055making on fast\055paced client engagements\056\nMentored 2 junior designers\073 served as Culture Champion for a 40\055person design team and copywriter for an internal tech newsletter distributed to 200\053 designers\056\nKey Impact\072\nDesigned a data marketplace interface that made AI\055driven products immediately legible to non\055technical executive buyers\054 contributing to the successful close of an approximately \0441M pharmaceutical deal\056\nUnified three legacy utility company platforms into a single digital experience for PPL\054 shipping on schedule for millions of customers with no service disruption\056\nReduced duplicate design effort and accelerated delivery across multiple workstreams through scalable component architecture used across 5\053 enterprise products\056\n\nUX\057UI Designer \240 HomeHero App\054 Chicago\054 IL\nJan 2021 \055 Aug 2021\nEstablished core UX foundations including 4 personas\054 sitemaps\054 and 6 user journey maps to guide early product decisions in an agile environment\056\nConducted 6 usability testing sessions to validate assumptions and inform iterative design improvements\073 led weekly stakeholder design reviews using interactive prototypes\056\n\nAccount Executive\054 Digital Advertising \240 Yelp\054 Inc\056\054 Chicago\054 IL\nJun 2017 \055 Jan 2018\nClosed \04430\054000 in new business within the first three months\073 pitched 25\053 custom digital advertising strategies per month to small business owners\056\n\nLEADERSHIP \046 COMMUNITY\nHead of Media \046 Marketing\nThe Tent CC \050non\055profit\051\054 Chicago\054 IL\nLead creative direction\073 manage cross\055functional team of designers\054 photographers\054 and videographers delivering social content and brand campaigns\056\nHead of Media \046 Technology\nBible Church of Reconciliation\054 Harvey\054 IL\nLead 15\053 person cross\055functional team\073 designed and launched a 6\055week training cohort\056 Grew YouTube to 1\054300 subscribers and Instagram to 3\054200 followers\056\n\nEDUCATION\nCertificate in UX\057UI Design\nSpringboard\240 \174\240 Aug 2020 \055 Jul 2021\nM\056S\056\054 Journalism\nUniversity of Illinois\054 Urbana\055Champaign\240 \174\240 Aug 2016 \055 May 2017\nB\056A\056\054 Broadcast Journalism\nUniversity of Illinois\054 Urbana\055Champaign\240 \174\240 Aug 2012 \055 May 2016\n\n\nPORTFOLIO\240 \174\240 UI\057UX \046 PRODUCT DESIGN\nSelected product and UX design work demonstrating end\055to\055end design process\054 enterprise design systems\054 and measurable client impact across Healthcare\054 Utilities\054 Financial Services\054 and B2B SaaS\056 Full portfolio\072 )
     /K [ 48 ]
     /P 1821 0 R
     /Pg 1724 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
